  "text": "insomnia; urinary retention/bladder and lower back pain; dizziness; forgetfulness; foggy brain; weight loss; poor appetite\nHave cyclical moderate depression, body pain and joint pain related to perimenopause and although it seemed to stave off the depression, it did nothing for body pain.\nDidn't mind the weight loss, but the urinary retention and bladder and back pain were very uncomfortable.\nWaking in the middle of the night and not being able to go back to sleep was big problem.\nFelt tired in morning and always late for work.\nReason for getting off was mostly regarding high cost of medication - even with insurance.\n",
